  "notes": "Imported only when you choose it. Headlines and publisher summaries are shown unedited, with that feed's credit and a link to the original article. No logos. Hacker News comes via the unofficial hnrss.org feed (not run by Y Combinator). Regional pages add a local paper beside BBC News. Sport pages add a specialist beside BBC Sport. Boxing is page 390. National papers (The Sun, the Daily Express, the Mirror and The Telegraph) are personal-use only. The Telegraph is paywalled: only its news feed is included, and the story shows that feed's standfirst. This file is what build 44 downloads from starter-pack-v2.json. Do not publish it at starter-pack.json: builds 42 and 43 reject the whole pack because Boxing is not a section they have. Publish netfax-nms-bbc-sky-v1.json there instead. Personal, non-commercial use per each publisher's RSS terms.",
